HECTOR data licence
===================

The DATA in this repository -- the commodity, unit, rate and dimension records (every
`ontology.json` under commodity/, unit/ and rate/), the slug ledgers (ledger/), and the
vocabulary (ontology/ and context/) -- is licensed under the

    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0)
